This server is built on the Pretendo Network NEX stack:

  - github.com/PretendoNetwork/nex-go
  - github.com/PretendoNetwork/nex-protocols-go
  - github.com/PretendoNetwork/nex-protocols-common-go
  - github.com/PretendoNetwork/plogger-go

all licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.

internal/nex-protocols-common-go-patch/ is a vendored fork of
nex-protocols-common-go with local DataStore changes (an S3 presigner and
adjusted DataStore method behaviour). It keeps its own upstream AGPL-3.0
LICENSE.

The matchmaking.* / tracking.* PostgreSQL schema is created by
nex-protocols-common-go itself (CommonProtocol.SetManager);
docs/matchmaking-schema.md keeps a reference map of that layout.

The Warriors Orochi 3 Hyper NEX configuration (game server ID 1010ea00 / 269543936,
access key d74bb27d, NEX 3.4.13) comes from the public kinnay.github.io Wii U
NEX database, cross-referenced with the retail EUR RPX. No proprietary
Nintendo or Koei Tecmo code or assets are included.
